          Hi [Name],<br><br>
          I'm pleased to formally accept the offer for [Role] at [Company]. I'm genuinely excited to join the team and I appreciate everyone's patience through the process.<br><br>
          Please let me know what I need to complete for next steps. Looking forward to starting.
        </div>

