        <div style="background:rgba(10,16,24,0.7); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius:10px; padding:18px; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8;">
          Subject: Re: [Role] Offer<br><br>
